{"id": "34343", "title": "与仇人共枕", "author": "宝贝", "category": "文学名著", "count": 35, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34343.htm", "intro": "她明明就只是在溪边浣纱，又没招谁惹谁，为什么会突然从水里跑出一个男人，还浑身“脏兮兮”的？她一片好心的救她，却换来他的粗声粗气，还说什么怕她危害到他，要将她软禁起来！他他他……有没有搞错啊!可她实在是饿到头昏脑胀，迫不得已，只好在他的草药中动手脚，请他好好的跟周公约个小会，让她落跑，谁知他居然在她自投罗网后，下定决心要她“跟伊走”！还动不动就抱着她“翻来覆去”，喂喂喂！先生，她可是有“家室”的女人耶！但这致命的吸引力愈来愈强烈，终于让她一步错、步步错，让她在无心之下，让他对她产生无边的恨意……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34343", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2182300.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2182301.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2182302.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2182303.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2182304.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2182305.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2182306.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2182307.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2182308.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2182309.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2182310.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2182311.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2182312.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2182313.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2182314.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2182315.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2182316.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2182317.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2182318.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2182319.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2182320.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2182321.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2182322.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2182323.html", "available": false}, {"title": "